                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "KNf3f",
                  "name": "Col 2 Title",
                  "fill": "#0C2340",
                  "content": "2. Regulasi SSR/CSR (Next.js)",
                  "fontFamily": "Fraunces",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "bold"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hRXbI",
                  "name": "Col 2 Body",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Thin SSR Orchestrator: app/page.tsx murni Server Component\n• Modular Domains: modules/hero, modules/about, modules/services, modules/portfolio, modules/contact\n• Leaf CSR Isolation: Direktif 'use client' hanya pada komponen daun interaktif (mobile-nav.tsx, search/filter, form)\n• SSoT Constants: Seluruh konten dan link terpusat di constants/helper.ts dalam format UPPER_SNAKE_CASE\n• Zero Magic Strings: Komponen tidak hardcode label konten",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Plus Jakarta Sans",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
