                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "• Deep Maritime Navy (#0C2340 / #132359): Melambangkan Selat Makassar & pesisir bahari Donggala\n• Forest/Coastal Emerald (#064E3B / #047857): Ekosistem mangrove, perbukitan & kelestarian alam\n• Terracotta/Amber Gold (#C2410C / #D97706): Identitas benang emas kain tenun Buya Bomba\n• Warm Sand Canvas (#FDFBF7 / #F3EEE3): Latar hangat pasir pantai Kaluku & Bonebula\n• Font Heading: Fraunces (Editorial heritage elegance)\n• Font Body: Plus Jakarta Sans (Modern tech clarity)",
